Z||000000||Dwayne Mohr||05-25-2001||09:50 PM||||My coupe sat for about a month waiting to get painted. Looks good now.  Sounds like diesel when it runs. It might have been getting louder before, I can't remember.  Sounds like one or more lifters. I have the roller lifters according to the VIN. Anyone know if they are prone to this.  I am going in tomorrow to pull the lifters and repair or replace.  Any advice will be greatly appreciated. Also advice on draining the coolant and insuring no air pockets would be great too.  TIA||||reg||9
